WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.640
 Depending on your 
  RStudio Cloud pricing plan, 

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:10.160
 you may have access to the ability to tune 
  your project resources. To access project 

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:14.800
 resources we'll need to be within a project 
  or an assignment on RStudio Cloud. 

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.440
 From here, we can click on the settings  

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:21.360
 icon at the top of our project 
  and navigate to the resources tab. 

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.840
 From here, we can change 
  the amount of memory allocation, 

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:29.120
 CPU allocation, and/or the background 
  execution limit. 

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.600
 RStudio Cloud's pricing is calculated 

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:37.720
 based on project hours, 
  and not project run time. As such, 

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:42.920
 note that changing our memory allocation 
  and/or changing our CPU allocation 

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:44.800
 will change the project hours  

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.920
 consumed by the project, 
  based on one hour of project runtime. 

